Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"duckdb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（分析 SQL 强项，窗口完备）。 窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT 等分析 SQL 为强项 官方文档。 单机内存/磁盘上限是天花板 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（分析 SQL 强项，窗口完备）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口函数、CTE、PIVOT 等分析 SQL 为强项 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单机内存/磁盘上限是天花板 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Analytical SQL is its strength). Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Single-node memory/disk is the ceiling (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Analytical SQL is its strength).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Window functions, CTEs, PIVOT — analytical SQL is its strength <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Single-node memory/disk is the ceiling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（DELETE即删；文件残留靠VACUUM）。 DELETE 删除行，但数据库文件历史页可能残留，需 VACUUM / 重写文件 社区共识 嵌入式场景下“擦除”等价于文件级管控：删文件最彻底 社区实测 无擦除证明 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（DELETE即删；文件残留靠VACUUM）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE 删除行，但数据库文件历史页可能残留，需 VACUUM / 重写文件 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>嵌入式场景下“擦除”等价于文件级管控：删文件最彻底 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>无擦除证明 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (DELETE removes rows; file residue needs VACUUM). DELETE removes rows, but database file history pages may retain data; VACUUM / file rewrite is needed (community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (DELETE removes rows; file residue needs VACUUM).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DELETE removes rows, but database file history pages may retain data; VACUUM / file rewrite is needed <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>In embedded scenarios erasure equals file-level control: deleting the file is the most thorough option <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>No erasure attestation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（嵌入式场景无血缘，查证为无）。 无原生血缘；嵌入式定位通常不需要 官方文档。 可通过上层工具链补齐 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（嵌入式场景无血缘，查证为无）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生血缘；嵌入式定位通常不需要 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>可通过上层工具链补齐 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified none; embedded scope needs none). No native lineage; embedded positioning rarely needs it <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Upper toolchains can fill the gap (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified none; embedded scope needs none).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native lineage; embedded positioning rarely needs it <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Upper toolchains can fill the gap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——无在线备份工具、无 WAL 归档、无 PITR。可用方式：EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)（MVCC 一致快照，可在线，是社区推荐默认方式）、COPY FROM DATABASE 跨库拷贝、进程关闭后直接拷贝 .duckdb 文件；打开状态下直接 cp 文件可能损坏<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。恢复…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——无在线备份工具、无 WAL 归档、无 PITR。可用方式：<code>EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)</code>（MVCC 一致快照，可在线，是社区推荐默认方式）、<code>COPY FROM DATABASE</code> 跨库拷贝、进程关闭后直接拷贝 <code>.duckdb</code> 文件；<strong>打开状态下直接 cp 文件可能损坏</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。恢复 = <code>IMPORT DATABASE</code> 或文件替换。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — no online backup tool, no WAL archiving, no PITR. Available: EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET) (MVCC-consistent snapshot, online, the community…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — no online backup tool, no WAL archiving, no PITR. Available: <code>EXPORT DATABASE &#x27;dir&#x27; (FORMAT PARQUET)</code> (MVCC-consistent snapshot, online, the community-recommended default), <code>COPY FROM DATABASE</code> for cross-database copies, copying the <code>.duckdb</code> file after the process closes; <strong>copying the file while the database is open can corrupt it</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Restore = <code>IMPORT DATABASE</code> or file replacement. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：进程内嵌入式）。 进程内嵌入式，存储即本地文件，存算一体 官方文档。 无网络开销，但无法独立扩展计算/存储 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：进程内嵌入式）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>进程内嵌入式，存储即本地文件，存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无网络开销，但无法独立扩展计算/存储 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: in-process embedded). In-process embedded; storage is local files; coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No network overhead, but compute/storage can&#x27;t scale indep…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: in-process embedded).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In-process embedded; storage is local files; coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No network overhead, but compute/storage can&#x27;t scale independently <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（关系+JSON+FTS/VSS 扩展）。 JSON 类型，FTS（全文）、VSS（向量）为官方扩展 官方文档。 无图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（关系+JSON+FTS/VSS 扩展）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON 类型，FTS（全文）、VSS（向量）为官方扩展 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Relational + JSON + FTS/VSS extensions). JSON type; FTS (full-text) and VSS (vector) as official extensions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No graph engine (community consensus…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Relational + JSON + FTS/VSS extensions).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSON type; FTS (full-text) and VSS (vector) as official extensions <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式无计费，成本并入宿主应用）。 嵌入式进程内运行，无独立计费概念，成本并入宿主应用的硬件与人力。社区共识 母公司 MotherDuck 的云托管版另有按量计费。厂商口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式无计费，成本并入宿主应用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嵌入式进程内运行，无独立计费概念，成本并入宿主应用的硬件与人力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>母公司 MotherDuck 的云托管版另有按量计费。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No metering; cost folds into host). Runs embedded in-process with no independent metering; cost folds into the host application&#x27;s hardware and labor. (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No metering; cost folds into host).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Runs embedded in-process with no independent metering; cost folds into the host application&#x27;s hardware and labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>MotherDuck&#x27;s hosted cloud edition has separate usage-based billing. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（嵌入式驱动全：Python/R/JDBC/ODBC）。 Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC 官方驱动完备 官方文档。 零依赖安装是开发体验优势 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（嵌入式驱动全：Python/R/JDBC/ODBC）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC 官方驱动完备 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>零依赖安装是开发体验优势 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Full embedded drivers: Python/R/JDBC/ODBC). Complete official Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Zero-dependency install is a DX win (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Full embedded drivers: Python/R/JDBC/ODBC).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Complete official Python/R/Node/Java/JDBC/ODBC drivers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Zero-dependency install is a DX win <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无；CTAS 模拟）。 无物化视图（查证为无）官方文档。 用 CREATE TABLE AS + 定时重建模拟 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无；CTAS 模拟）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>用 CREATE TABLE AS + 定时重建模拟 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified absent; CTAS instead). No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Simulate with CREATE TABLE AS + scheduled rebuilds (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified absent; CTAS instead).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Simulate with CREATE TABLE AS + scheduled rebuilds <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（嵌入式，无云绑定）。 嵌入式库，跑在哪里由宿主决定，无云厂商绑定 官方文档。 跨云概念不适用，文件拷到哪里算哪里 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（嵌入式，无云绑定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嵌入式库，跑在哪里由宿主决定，无云厂商绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云概念不适用，文件拷到哪里算哪里 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Embedded; no cloud binding). Embedded library; the host decides where it runs — no cloud binding <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-cloud is N/A; the file runs wherever you copy…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Embedded; no cloud binding).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Embedded library; the host decides where it runs — no cloud binding <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud is N/A; the file runs wherever you copy it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——有：EXPLAIN / EXPLAIN ANALYZE、PRAGMA profiling（json 输出可画火焰图）、duckdb_memory()、pragma_database_size()、duckdb_temporary_files()、duckdb_settings()、duckdb_databases()；查证为无…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——有：<code>EXPLAIN</code> / <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>、PRAGMA profiling（json 输出可画火焰图）、<code>duckdb_memory()</code>、<code>pragma_database_size()</code>、<code>duckdb_temporary_files()</code>、<code>duckdb_settings()</code>、<code>duckdb_databases()</code>；<strong>查证为无</strong>：慢查询日志、跨会话查询历史（<code>duckdb_queries()</code>/<code>duckdb_connections()</code> 不存在，社区探针 v1.5.5 实测确认）、<code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code>。证据：官方文档 + 社区实测。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — has EXPLAIN / EXPLAIN ANALYZE, PRAGMA profiling (JSON output, flamegraph-able), duckdb_memory(), pragma_database_size(), duckdb_temporary_files(), d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — has <code>EXPLAIN</code> / <code>EXPLAIN ANALYZE</code>, PRAGMA profiling (JSON output, flamegraph-able), <code>duckdb_memory()</code>, <code>pragma_database_size()</code>, <code>duckdb_temporary_files()</code>, <code>duckdb_settings()</code>, <code>duckdb_databases()</code>; <strong>verified absent</strong>: slow-query log, cross-session query history (<code>duckdb_queries()</code> / <code>duckdb_connections()</code> don&#x27;t exist, confirmed by a community probe on v1.5.5), <code>PRAGMA integrity_check</code>. Evidence: official docs + community testing.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——进程内连接，创建开销极低；查询自动用满全部 CPU 核心（SET threads 可调）；无网络往返、无连接池概念（不需要）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——进程内连接，创建开销极低；查询自动用满全部 CPU 核心（<code>SET threads</code> 可调）；无网络往返、无连接池概念（不需要）。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — in-process connections with negligible setup cost; queries automatically use all CPU cores (SET threads adjustable); no network round-trips, no connection poo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — in-process connections with negligible setup cost; queries automatically use all CPU cores (<code>SET threads</code> adjustable); no network round-trips, no connection pooling concept (none needed). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有——ACID；为批量优化的 MVCC（借鉴 HyPer），默认快照隔离（Snapshot Isolation）；进程内多线程写走乐观并发：append 永不冲突，并发 update/delete 同一行后者报冲突失败；跨进程只允许&quot;单进程读写&quot;或&quot;多进程只读&quot;，第二进程写会报文件锁错误；无 SAVEPOINT<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>——ACID；为批量优化的 MVCC（借鉴 HyPer），默认快照隔离（Snapshot Isolation）；进程内多线程写走乐观并发：append 永不冲突，并发 update/delete 同一行后者报冲突失败；跨进程只允许&quot;单进程读写&quot;或&quot;多进程只读&quot;，第二进程写会报文件锁错误；<strong>无 SAVEPOINT</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（concurrency）+ 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported — ACID; batch-optimized MVCC (HyPer-inspired), default snapshot isolation; in-process multi-threaded writes use optimistic concurrency: appends never conflict, …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> — ACID; batch-optimized MVCC (HyPer-inspired), default snapshot isolation; in-process multi-threaded writes use optimistic concurrency: appends never conflict, concurrent update/delete of the same row fails the later one; cross-process only allows &quot;single process read-write&quot; or &quot;multiple processes read-only&quot; — a second writer gets a file-lock error; <strong>no SAVEPOINT</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Evidence: official docs (concurrency) + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用——单机进程内引擎，无复制协议、无多副本一致性；&quot;多副本&quot; = 文件拷贝；多机协作靠 DuckLake（对象存储 + 元数据）或 MotherDuck；Quack client-server 协议 2026-05 技术预览、beta 中。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>——单机进程内引擎，无复制协议、无多副本一致性；&quot;多副本&quot; = 文件拷贝；多机协作靠 DuckLake（对象存储 + 元数据）或 MotherDuck；Quack client-server 协议 2026-05 技术预览、beta 中。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A — single-node</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A — single-node in-process engine, no replication protocol, no multi-copy consistency; &quot;more copies&quot; = file copies; multi-node collaboration via DuckLake (object storag…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> — single-node in-process engine, no replication protocol, no multi-copy consistency; &quot;more copies&quot; = file copies; multi-node collaboration via DuckLake (object storage + metadata) or MotherDuck; the Quack client-server protocol is in technical preview/beta (May 2026). Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "duckdb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——纵向扩展（scale-up）有：多核并行 + 外存溢出，单机吃到 GB~数百 GB；横向扩展（scale-out）查证为无：引擎本身不支持分布式查询，多机方案只有 MotherDuck 托管（serverless ducklings）或应用层分片。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——纵向扩展（scale-up）<strong>有</strong>：多核并行 + 外存溢出，单机吃到 GB~数百 GB；横向扩展（scale-out）<strong>查证为无</strong>：引擎本身不支持分布式查询，多机方案只有 MotherDuck 托管（serverless ducklings）或应用层分片。证据：官方文档 + 社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — scale-up supported: multi-core parallelism + out-of-core spilling, single node handles GBs to hundreds of GBs; scale-out verified absent: the engine…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — scale-up <strong>supported</strong>: multi-core parallelism + out-of-core spilling, single node handles GBs to hundreds of GBs; scale-out <strong>verified absent</strong>: the engine has no distributed queries; multi-node options are MotherDuck managed (serverless ducklings) or application-level sharding. Evidence: official docs + community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有表默认 AES-256 落盘加密；三档：AWS owned key（默认）、AWS managed key（aws/dynamodb）、customer managed KMS key（自带轮换策略、CloudTrail 审计密钥使用）。注意：AWS owned key 无可见性，合规场景必须显式切 CMK。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有表默认 AES-256 落盘加密；三档：AWS owned key（默认）、AWS managed key（<code>aws/dynamodb</code>）、customer managed KMS key（自带轮换策略、CloudTrail 审计密钥使用）。注意：AWS owned key 无可见性，合规场景必须显式切 CMK。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All tables encrypted on disk with AES-256 by default; three tiers: AWS owned key (default), AWS managed key (aws/dynamodb), customer managed KM…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All tables encrypted on disk with AES-256 by default; three tiers: AWS owned key (default), AWS managed key (<code>aws/dynamodb</code>), customer managed KMS key (bring your own rotation policy; key usage audited via CloudTrail). Note: AWS owned keys offer no visibility — compliance scenarios must explicitly switch to a CMK.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有 API 走 HTTPS/TLS；SDK 默认；支持 VPC endpoint 私有访问不走公网。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。所有 API 走 HTTPS/TLS；SDK 默认；支持 VPC endpoint 私有访问不走公网。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All API calls go over HTTPS/TLS; SDK default; VPC endpoints supported for private access without going over the public internet.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. All API calls go over HTTPS/TLS; SDK default; VPC endpoints supported for private access without going over the public internet.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。专有 NoSQL API（GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact）+ PartiQL（SQL 方言子集，功能弱于真 SQL）；AWS SDK 全语言；DynamoDB Local 供本地开发。无 MySQL/PG/Oracle 协…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。专有 NoSQL API（GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact）+ PartiQL（SQL 方言子集，功能弱于真 SQL）；AWS SDK 全语言；DynamoDB Local 供本地开发。<strong>无</strong> MySQL/PG/Oracle 协议，无开源发行版，迁出=重写数据访问层。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Proprietary NoSQL API (GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact) + PartiQL (a SQL-dialect subset, weaker than …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Proprietary NoSQL API (GetItem/PutItem/UpdateItem/DeleteItem/Query/Scan/Batch/Transact) + PartiQL (a SQL-dialect subset, weaker than real SQL); AWS SDKs in all languages; DynamoDB Local for local development. <strong>No</strong> MySQL/PG/Oracle protocol (confirmed absent), no open-source distribution (confirmed absent) — migrating away = rewriting the data-access layer.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p class=\"snippet\">闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。按量付费：on-demand 按读写请求单元、provisioned 按 RCU/WCU-小时、存储 GB-月、PITR、备份存储、Global Tables 复制写（rWCU）、Streams 读取、DAX 另计；Standard-IA 表类降存储费。AWS 锁定是最大商业现实：无他云、无自建。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>闭源商业<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。按量付费：on-demand 按读写请求单元、provisioned 按 RCU/WCU-小时、存储 GB-月、PITR、备份存储、Global Tables 复制写（rWCU）、Streams 读取、DAX 另计；Standard-IA 表类降存储费。<strong>AWS 锁定是最大商业现实</strong>：无他云、无自建。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p class=\"snippet\">Closed-source commercial <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pay-as-you-go: on-demand billed per read/write request unit, provisioned billed per RCU/WCU-hour, storage GB-month, PITR, backup…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p>Closed-source commercial <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pay-as-you-go: on-demand billed per read/write request unit, provisioned billed per RCU/WCU-hour, storage GB-month, PITR, backup storage, Global Tables replicated writes (rWCU), Streams reads, DAX billed separately; Standard-IA table class lowers storage fees. <strong>AWS lock-in is the biggest commercial reality</strong>: no other cloud, no self-hosting.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p class=\"snippet\">中等<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/掘金/知乎）不少，但深度建模（单表设计、GSI 成本）内容多为英文。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>中等</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/掘金/知乎）不少，但深度建模（单表设计、GSI 成本）内容多为英文。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Medium</span><p class=\"snippet\">Medium <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; there are plenty of Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/Juejin/Zh…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Medium</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; there are plenty of Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/Juejin/Zhihu), but deep modeling content (single-table design, GSI cost) is mostly in English.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Serverless 下个位数毫秒 P99；热分区是坑）。 官方口径：任意规模个位数毫秒 P99；DAX 提供微秒级缓存 厂商口径。 按需/预置容量模式；热分区限流是主要性能坑，分区键设计是关键 社区共识。 大 scan/跨分区查询贵且慢，建模时就要避免 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Serverless 下个位数毫秒 P99；热分区是坑）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>官方口径：任意规模个位数毫秒 P99；DAX 提供微秒级缓存 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>按需/预置容量模式；热分区限流是主要性能坑，分区键设计是关键 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>大 scan/跨分区查询贵且慢，建模时就要避免 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (single-digit ms P99 serverless; hot partitions are the pitfall). Officially single-digit-millisecond P99 at any scale; DAX adds microsecond caching (vendor cla…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (single-digit ms P99 serverless; hot partitions are the pitfall).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Officially single-digit-millisecond P99 at any scale; DAX adds microsecond caching <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>On-demand/provisioned capacity modes; hot-partition throttling is the main performance pitfall — partition-key design is key <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Large scans/cross-partition queries are expensive and slow; avoid them at modeling time <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（继承 AWS 合规体系）。 AWS：SOC2、ISO27001、PCI DSS、HIPAA 等<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 中国区（北京/宁夏）参与等保测评 厂商口径。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（继承 AWS 合规体系）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS：SOC2、ISO27001、PCI DSS、HIPAA 等<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>中国区（北京/宁夏）参与等保测评 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (inherits AWS compliance system). AWS: SOC2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, HIPAA, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. China regions (Beijing/Ningxia) undergo MLPS assessm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (inherits AWS compliance system).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>AWS: SOC2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, HIPAA, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>China regions (Beijing/Ningxia) undergo MLPS assessment <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（2012 年 GA；Serverless KV 的定义者）。 2012 年 GA（源自 2007 Dynamo 论文）；AWS 核心服务之一 社区共识。 行为稳定，API 十余年基本不动；向后兼容口碑好 社区共识。 闭源云服务，能力演进由 AWS 排期 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（2012 年 GA；Serverless KV 的定义者）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012 年 GA（源自 2007 Dynamo 论文）；AWS 核心服务之一 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>行为稳定，API 十余年基本不动；向后兼容口碑好 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>闭源云服务，能力演进由 AWS 排期 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (GA 2012; defined serverless KV). GA 2012 (from the 2007 Dynamo paper); a core AWS service <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Stable behavior with a mostly unchanged API fo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (GA 2012; defined serverless KV).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GA 2012 (from the 2007 Dynamo paper); a core AWS service <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Stable behavior with a mostly unchanged API for over a decade; strong backward-compatibility reputation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Closed cloud service; feature evolution follows AWS&#x27;s roadmap <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__16": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 内部+海量外部用户）。 Snap 等公开大规模案例<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>厂商口径。 AWS 内部大量服务依赖 DynamoDB 社区共识。 Serverless 架构的首选 KV，初创公司采用极广 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 内部+海量外部用户）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Snap 等公开大规模案例<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span><span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>AWS 内部大量服务依赖 DynamoDB <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Serverless 架构的首选 KV，初创公司采用极广 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (inside AWS plus massive external use). Public hyperscale cases: Snap, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Many internal AWS services depend on DynamoDB (commun…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (inside AWS plus massive external use).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Public hyperscale cases: Snap, etc. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Many internal AWS services depend on DynamoDB <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The default KV for serverless architectures; extremely broad startup adoption <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__17": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Streams 做 CDC；备份按需/PITR）。 备份：按需备份+PITR（35 天）官方文档。 CDC：DynamoDB Streams（+Lambda 触发器）官方文档。 迁移：AWS DMS；导出到 S3（Parquet）做分析 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Streams 做 CDC；备份按需/PITR）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>备份：按需备份+PITR（35 天）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>CDC：DynamoDB Streams（+Lambda 触发器）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>迁移：AWS DMS；导出到 S3（Parquet）做分析 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Streams for CDC; on-demand/PITR backup). Backup: on-demand + PITR (35 days) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CDC: DynamoDB Streams (+ Lambda triggers) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Migrati…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Streams for CDC; on-demand/PITR backup).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Backup: on-demand + PITR (35 days) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>CDC: DynamoDB Streams (+ Lambda triggers) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Migration: AWS DMS; export to S3 (Parquet) for analytics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__18": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（纯 Serverless，无自建版）。 DynamoDB 本身就是 Serverless：无服务器概念，按需/预置 官方文档。 无自建版；本地开发用 DynamoDB Local（功能子集）官方文档。 AWS 绑定 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（纯 Serverless，无自建版）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 本身就是 Serverless：无服务器概念，按需/预置 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无自建版；本地开发用 DynamoDB Local（功能子集）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>AWS 绑定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (pure serverless; no self-hosted edition). DynamoDB is itself serverless: no servers, on-demand/provisioned <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No self-hosted edition; DynamoDB Lo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (pure serverless; no self-hosted edition).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB is itself serverless: no servers, on-demand/provisioned <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No self-hosted edition; DynamoDB Local (feature subset) for development <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>AWS-bound <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__19": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（S3 导入、BatchWriteItem、zero-ETL）。 Import from S3（CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION）是官方批量导入通道 官方文档。 BatchWriteItem + 并行是 SDK 侧常规做法，注意 WCU 与限流 社区共识。 DynamoDB zero-ETL 集成到 Redshift 是新通道…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（S3 导入、BatchWriteItem、zero-ETL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Import from S3（CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION）是官方批量导入通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>BatchWriteItem + 并行是 SDK 侧常规做法，注意 WCU 与限流 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>DynamoDB zero-ETL 集成到 Redshift 是新通道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (S3 import, BatchWriteItem, zero-ETL). Import from S3 (CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION) is the official bulk channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. BatchWriteItem with parallelism is t…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (S3 import, BatchWriteItem, zero-ETL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Import from S3 (CSV/DynamoDB JSON/ION) is the official bulk channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>BatchWriteItem with parallelism is the standard SDK approach; watch WCU and throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>DynamoDB zero-ETL integration to Redshift is a newer channel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录管理面 API（建表、改容量、改策略）；数据面（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudTrail 记录<strong>管理面</strong> API（建表、改容量、改策略）；<strong>数据面</strong>（GetItem/PutItem/Query）默认无审计，靠 CloudTrail data events（需单独启用、按量收费）或应用层日志。没有 SQL 审计日志式的&quot;谁查了哪行&quot;开箱能力。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records management-plane API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the data plane (GetItem/PutItem/Que…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudTrail records <strong>management-plane</strong> API calls (table creation, capacity changes, policy changes); the <strong>data plane</strong> (GetItem/PutItem/Query) has no auditing by default — rely on CloudTrail data events (must be enabled separately, metered billing) or application-layer logging. There is no out-of-the-box &quot;who read which row&quot; SQL-audit-log-style capability.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（自身无外部表；Athena 可联邦查 DynamoDB）。 DynamoDB 无外部表语义 官方文档。 Athena DynamoDB 连接器可做联邦查询 官方文档。 PartiQL 只能查本表，跨源要在上层做 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（自身无外部表；Athena 可联邦查 DynamoDB）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 无外部表语义 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Athena DynamoDB 连接器可做联邦查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>PartiQL 只能查本表，跨源要在上层做 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (No external tables natively; Athena can federate into DynamoDB). DynamoDB has no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The Athena DynamoDB connec…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (No external tables natively; Athena can federate into DynamoDB).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB has no external-table semantics <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Athena DynamoDB connector enables federated queries <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>PartiQL only queries local tables; cross-source joins happen upstream <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（DynamoDB Streams：Lambda/Kinesis）。 DynamoDB Streams 提供 24 小时变更日志，可接 Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams 官方文档。 Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB 支持更长保留与多消费者 官方文档。 大写入量下 Stream 分片…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（DynamoDB Streams：Lambda/Kinesis）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB Streams 提供 24 小时变更日志，可接 Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB 支持更长保留与多消费者 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大写入量下 Stream 分片热点与 Lambda 并发是调优点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (DynamoDB Streams: Lambda/Kinesis). DynamoDB Streams provide a 24-hour change log feeding Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Kinesis Data Streams for …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (DynamoDB Streams: Lambda/Kinesis).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB Streams provide a 24-hour change log feeding Lambda/Kinesis Data Streams <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Kinesis Data Streams for DynamoDB adds longer retention and multiple consumers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Stream shard hotspots and Lambda concurrency matter at high write rates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（表级 TTL 属性，后台自动删不耗 WCU）。 表上指定 TTL 属性（epoch 秒），过期项后台自动删，不消耗写容量 官方文档。 删除延迟通常几小时内，不保证精确时刻 官方文档。 TTL 删除会产生 DynamoDB Streams 记录，可触发下游清理 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（表级 TTL 属性，后台自动删不耗 WCU）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>表上指定 TTL 属性（epoch 秒），过期项后台自动删，不消耗写容量 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>删除延迟通常几小时内，不保证精确时刻 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>TTL 删除会产生 DynamoDB Streams 记录，可触发下游清理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Table-level TTL attribute; background deletes free of WCU). Designate a TTL attribute (epoch seconds); expired items are deleted in the background with no writ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Table-level TTL attribute; background deletes free of WCU).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Designate a TTL attribute (epoch seconds); expired items are deleted in the background with no write-capacity cost <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Deletion lags by hours typically; not exact <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>TTL deletions emit DynamoDB Streams records, useful for downstream cleanup <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（schemaless，无 DDL 概念）。 无 schema，属性随时增减，无 DDL 痛点 官方文档。 加 GSI 是在线后台构建，大表回填耗时但不阻塞 官方文档。 GSI 回填期间写放大，WCU 规划要留余量 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（schemaless，无 DDL 概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无 schema，属性随时增减，无 DDL 痛点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>加 GSI 是在线后台构建，大表回填耗时但不阻塞 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>GSI 回填期间写放大，WCU 规划要留余量 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Schemaless; no DDL concept). No schema; attributes come and go with no DDL pain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding a GSI builds online in the background; backfills take time on…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Schemaless; no DDL concept).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No schema; attributes come and go with no DDL pain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Adding a GSI builds online in the background; backfills take time on huge tables but don&#x27;t block <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>GSI backfill amplifies writes — leave WCU headroom <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（表级吞吐隔离；无集群内多租户）。 租户隔离靠多表/多账号，表级 WCU/按需计费天然隔离 官方文档。 单表内多租户无资源限流，需应用层分区键设计 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（表级吞吐隔离；无集群内多租户）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>租户隔离靠多表/多账号，表级 WCU/按需计费天然隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单表内多租户无资源限流，需应用层分区键设计 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Table-level throughput isolation; no in-cluster tenancy). Tenant isolation via multiple tables/accounts; per-table WCU/on-demand billing isolates naturally (offi…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Table-level throughput isolation; no in-cluster tenancy).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tenant isolation via multiple tables/accounts; per-table WCU/on-demand billing isolates naturally <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No resource throttling for multi-tenant single tables; design partition keys in the app <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Global Tables 多活写）。 Global Tables 多区多活写，最终一致，冲突 last-writer-wins 官方文档。 冲突解决粗糙，不适合强一致多写场景 社区共识。 跨区复制延迟通常 1 秒内 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Global Tables 多活写）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Tables 多区多活写，最终一致，冲突 last-writer-wins <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>冲突解决粗糙，不适合强一致多写场景 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区复制延迟通常 1 秒内 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Global Tables active-active writes). Global Tables: multi-region active writes, eventually consistent, last-writer-wins conflicts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Crude confli…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Global Tables active-active writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Global Tables: multi-region active writes, eventually consistent, last-writer-wins conflicts <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Crude conflict resolution; unfit for strong-consistency multi-write needs <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region replication lag typically under a second <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（托管多 AZ，SLA 99.99%）。 数据多 AZ 同步复制，AZ 故障自动容错 官方文档。 Global Tables 另有 99.999% SLA 档 官方文档。 RTO/RPO 由平台兜底，用户无感知 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（托管多 AZ，SLA 99.99%）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>数据多 AZ 同步复制，AZ 故障自动容错 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>Global Tables 另有 99.999% SLA 档 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RTO/RPO 由平台兜底，用户无感知 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Managed multi-AZ; 99.99% SLA). Data replicates synchronously across AZs with automatic AZ-failure tolerance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Global Tables offer a 99.999% SLA …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Managed multi-AZ; 99.99% SLA).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data replicates synchronously across AZs with automatic AZ-failure tolerance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Global Tables offer a 99.999% SLA tier <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RTO/RPO are the platform&#x27;s problem; users notice nothing <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（IAM条件键做细粒度行级控制）。 DynamoDB 无引擎内 RLS，官方推荐用 IAM policy 的 condition keys（如 dynamodb:LeadingKeys）实现按分区键的行级隔离 官方文档 列级控制靠 IAM 属性级权限（特定属性允许 / 拒绝） 官方文档 脱敏无内置能力，靠应用层 社区共识 IAM …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（IAM条件键做细粒度行级控制）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 无引擎内 RLS，官方推荐用 IAM policy 的 condition keys（如 dynamodb:LeadingKeys）实现按分区键的行级隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>列级控制靠 IAM 属性级权限（特定属性允许 / 拒绝） <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>脱敏无内置能力，靠应用层 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>IAM 策略复杂度随租户数膨胀，是主要运维成本 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Fine-grained row control via IAM condition keys). DynamoDB has no in-engine RLS; AWS recommends IAM policy condition keys (e.g. dynamodb:LeadingKeys) for partiti…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Fine-grained row control via IAM condition keys).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB has no in-engine RLS; AWS recommends IAM policy condition keys (e.g. dynamodb:LeadingKeys) for partition-key row isolation <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Column control via IAM attribute-level permissions (allow / deny specific attributes) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No built-in masking; the app layer handles it <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>IAM policy complexity balloons with tenant count, a major operational cost <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（文档模型原生，Map/List 嵌套）。 Map/List 嵌套文档原生，DynamoDB JSON 与 SDK 互转 官方文档。 单 item 400KB 上限，深嵌套文档注意条目大小 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（文档模型原生，Map/List 嵌套）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Map/List 嵌套文档原生，DynamoDB JSON 与 SDK 互转 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>单 item 400KB 上限，深嵌套文档注意条目大小 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Native nested Map/List documents). Native nested Map/List documents; DynamoDB JSON interop with SDKs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. 400KB per-item cap; watch size on deeply …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Native nested Map/List documents).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Native nested Map/List documents; DynamoDB JSON interop with SDKs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>400KB per-item cap; watch size on deeply nested docs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无；外挂 OpenSearch）。 无全文检索（查证为无）官方文档。 标准方案 DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch，延迟与成本自负 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无；外挂 OpenSearch）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无全文检索（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>标准方案 DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch，延迟与成本自负 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified absent; use OpenSearch). No full-text search (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Standard: DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch; latency and cost on you (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified absent; use OpenSearch).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No full-text search (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Standard: DynamoDB Streams + OpenSearch; latency and cost on you <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（dynamodb:LeadingKeys 行级、dynamodb:Attributes 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无用户名密码，IAM SigV4 签名；细粒度访问控制（<code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code> 行级、<code>dynamodb:Attributes</code> 列级），多租户隔离的标准做法。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via dynamodb:LeadingKeys, column-level via dynamodb:Attribut…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No username/password; IAM SigV4 signatures; fine-grained access control (row-level via <code>dynamodb:LeadingKeys</code>, column-level via <code>dynamodb:Attributes</code>) — the standard practice for multi-tenant isolation.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（存储黑盒；按量计费无调优）。 存储层为 AWS 黑盒自动管理，用户按存储量与读写容量付费，无压缩调优参数。官方文档 官方未公开压缩算法与压缩比，存储效率不可观测、不可调。待验证 单表设计等建模技巧可减少冗余，属应用层优化而非引擎压缩能力。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（存储黑盒；按量计费无调优）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层为 AWS 黑盒自动管理，用户按存储量与读写容量付费，无压缩调优参数。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>官方未公开压缩算法与压缩比，存储效率不可观测、不可调。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>单表设计等建模技巧可减少冗余，属应用层优化而非引擎压缩能力。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Black-box storage; usage-based billing). The storage layer is AWS-managed black box; users pay for storage and read/write capacity with no compression tunables. …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Black-box storage; usage-based billing).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The storage layer is AWS-managed black box; users pay for storage and read/write capacity with no compression tunables. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Compression algorithms and ratios are undisclosed; storage efficiency is neither observable nor tunable. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Modeling techniques like single-table design reduce redundancy, but that is application-layer optimization, not engine compression. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（AWS 专属；API 绑定深）。 DynamoDB 是 AWS 专属托管 NoSQL 服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。官方文档 API 与数据建模（单表设计、GSI/LSI）深度绑定，迁出需重构访问模式。社区共识 存在开源兼容实现（如测试级 LocalStack），但生产级替代缺失。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（AWS 专属；API 绑定深）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB 是 AWS 专属托管 NoSQL 服务，无开源版本，完全绑定 AWS。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>API 与数据建模（单表设计、GSI/LSI）深度绑定，迁出需重构访问模式。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>存在开源兼容实现（如测试级 LocalStack），但生产级替代缺失。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (AWS-exclusive; deep API binding). DynamoDB is an AWS-exclusive managed NoSQL service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> Its API a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (AWS-exclusive; deep API binding).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>DynamoDB is an AWS-exclusive managed NoSQL service with no open-source edition, fully bound to AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Its API and data modeling (single-table design, GSI/LSI) bind deeply; migrating out requires reworking access patterns. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Open-source-compatible implementations exist (e.g. test-grade LocalStack), but no production-grade alternative. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（无优化器：单表设计，查询固定）。 无 CBO/计划概念，性能由单表建模与 GSI 设计决定 官方文档。 查询模式固定，可预测性强，但复杂查询需应用层组装 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（无优化器：单表设计，查询固定）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无 CBO/计划概念，性能由单表建模与 GSI 设计决定 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>查询模式固定，可预测性强，但复杂查询需应用层组装 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No optimizer: single-table design, fixed patterns). No CBO/plan concept; performance comes from single-table modeling and GSI design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Fixed access pa…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No optimizer: single-table design, fixed patterns).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No CBO/plan concept; performance comes from single-table modeling and GSI design <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Fixed access patterns are highly predictable, but complex queries need app-side assembly <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Serverless 自治：零调参）。 按需/预置+自动扩缩容，几乎零参数 官方文档。 容量规划转为 WCU/RCU 成本规划 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Serverless 自治：零调参）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>按需/预置+自动扩缩容，几乎零参数 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>容量规划转为 WCU/RCU 成本规划 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Serverless autonomy: zero knobs). On-demand/provisioned with auto scaling; near-zero parameters <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Capacity planning becomes WCU/RCU cost plannin…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Serverless autonomy: zero knobs).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>On-demand/provisioned with auto scaling; near-zero parameters <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Capacity planning becomes WCU/RCU cost planning <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。 存储层多副本同步复制，底层校验与自愈由 AWS 内部完成。官方文档 用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。社区共识 连续备份/PITR 防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（云厂商底层兜底，用户无可见校验开关）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储层多副本同步复制，底层校验与自愈由 AWS 内部完成。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>用户侧无页校验开关、校验命令或损坏审计视图。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>连续备份/PITR 防的是逻辑损坏，静默位损坏不在用户可观测范围。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud checks; no user controls). Multi-copy synchronous replication with low-level checks and self-healing handled internally by AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> No user-fac…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud checks; no user controls).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Multi-copy synchronous replication with low-level checks and self-healing handled internally by AWS. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-facing checksum switch, verification command, or corruption audit view. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>Continuous backups/PITR guard against logical corruption; silent bit-rot is outside user observability. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（KV 无过程语言概念）。 无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）官方文档。 流处理靠 Streams + Lambda 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（KV 无过程语言概念）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无存储过程/触发器概念（不适用）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>流处理靠 Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (No procedural concept in KV). No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Stream processing via Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (No procedural concept in KV).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored-procedure/trigger concept (N/A) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Stream processing via Streams + Lambda <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（无外键/CHECK；条件写入）。 无外键、CHECK（查证为无），条件写入做乐观锁 官方文档。 完整性应用层保证 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（无外键/CHECK；条件写入）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无外键、CHECK（查证为无），条件写入做乐观锁 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>完整性应用层保证 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (No FK/CHECK; conditional writes). No FK or CHECK (verified absent); conditional writes for optimistic locking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Integrity in app layer (comm…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (No FK/CHECK; conditional writes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No FK or CHECK (verified absent); conditional writes for optimistic locking <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Integrity in app layer <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "dynamodb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">不适用</span><p class=\"snippet\">不适用（PartiQL 有限；分析靠导出）。 PartiQL 查询能力有限，无窗口函数（不适用分析 SQL）官方文档。 分析靠导出 S3 + Athena/EMR 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>不适用</strong>（PartiQL 有限；分析靠导出）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PartiQL 查询能力有限，无窗口函数（不适用分析 SQL）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>分析靠导出 S3 + Athena/EMR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">N/A</span><p class=\"snippet\">N/A (Limited PartiQL; export for analytics). Limited PartiQL, no window functions (N/A for analytical SQL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Analytics via export to S3 + Athena/EMR (offic…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>N/A</strong> (Limited PartiQL; export for analytics).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Limited PartiQL, no window functions (N/A for analytical SQL) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Analytics via export to S3 + Athena/EMR <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});